=== Group ===
From 1945, Guy Boyd exhibited in group shows in all Australian State capitals,<ref>{{Citation | author1=Blackman, Charles | author2=Blackman, Charles, 1928-2018 | author3=National Gallery of Victoria | title=The antipodeans revisited : Melbourne figurative artists of the 1950s | date=1976 | publisher=National Gallery of Victoria | isbn=978-0-7241-0025-5 }}</ref> with representation as recently as 2012,<ref>{{Citation | author1=Savill Galleries, (host institution.) | title=Celebrated Australian artists : 23 October-14 November 2012 | date=2012 | publisher=Savill Galleries | url=https://trove.nla.gov.au/work/29491056 | access-date=28 September 2019 }}</ref> and overseas, including [[Leicester Galleries]], London in 1957, and at galleries in New York, San Francisco and Montreal.

